        <mxCell id="n12" value="时限驱动贪心派发：按&lt;br&gt;(n&lt;sub&gt;fb&lt;/sub&gt;, fb&lt;sub&gt;late&lt;/sub&gt;, n&lt;sub&gt;exp&lt;/sub&gt;, exp&lt;sub&gt;late&lt;/sub&gt;, slack, E) 择优" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fcead9;strokeColor=#c08b5c;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#262626;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei,PingFang SC,Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="752" width="420" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
